# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout, so sources are
# byte-identical on the Linux, macOS and Windows CI runners.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never line-ending converted or diffed as text.
# `text=auto` would normally detect these, but marking them is explicit and
# removes any dependence on git's content heuristic.
*.rda binary
*.RData binary
*.rds binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
